  "$comment_segments": "What kind of buyer a product is FOR. A product may sit in several. Segments are per-category because 'flagship' means nothing for a cooling pad.",
  "$comment_specification_groups": "How specs are presented, per category. Presentation only — retrieval never depends on grouping. A key absent from every group still filters; it just does not get a heading.",
  "$comment_accessory_types": "The accessory kinds a product can declare it accepts, in compatibility.compatible_accessory_types. Each maps to a taxonomy slug so the engine can go and find real products."
